diff -ruN a/src/bc5/title_settings.hpp b/src/bc5/title_settings.hpp
--- a/src/bc5/title_settings.hpp	1970-01-01 01:00:00.000000000 +0100
+++ b/src/bc5/title_settings.hpp	2026-11-19 14:28:19.464171200 +0100
